*.atomwrite-*
*atomwrite-*
# --- name contains: .atom_ ---
*.atom_*
*atom_*
# --- name contains: .atom- ---
*.atom-*
*atom-*
# --- name contains: ._agent_tmp ---
*._agent_tmp*
._agent_tmp*
# --- name contains: agent_tmp ---
*agent_tmp*
